zimg
------------------------------------------
Scaling, colorspace conversion, and dithering library

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  libzimg-devel-3.0.6-1bl2
  libzimg2-3.0.6-1bl2
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20260320-2
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libgtest-devel-1.18.0-1bl1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/sekrit-twc/zimg

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/sekrit-twc/zimg/archive/refs/tags/release-3.0.6.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack zimg-3.0.6-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./zimg-3.0.6-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/zimg-3.0.6-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/zimg-3.0.6-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libzimg2-3.0.6-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libzimg-devel-3.0.6-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

